= Reducing Stigma

We can lessen the chance of a guest ban by taking necessary measures.

- @roblox: Build relationship with roblox.
- @guest: Persuade guests to stay on the good side.
- @ban: Track down evil guests.
- @root: We either can't or will not do actions rn
- @easy_discard

@roblox
subtitle: -1 resource
choose-if: resource > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1

@guest
subtitle: -1 resource
choose-if: resource > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1

@ban
subtitle: -1 resource
choose-if: resource > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1
